<p style='background:white;word-break:break-word'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:#1F2937'>To secure a role in a well-established
organization where I can apply my marketing knowledge, MS Office expertise,
graphic design skills, and strong interpersonal abilities to create measurable
impact.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

